v, official docs, Wikipedia for foundational concepts, official YouTube channels); avoid blog hosts likely to break (medium, towardsdatascience)\",\n        \"Skill instructs: every source MUST have non-empty title; author + year strongly preferred for papers/books\",\n        \"scripts/ralph/skills/init_course/SKILL.md updated: research step (Step 2) now explicitly produces a sources.md file alongside research.md, listing collected references; per-lesson stories in generated prd.json carry source hints in notes field so generate_lesson can pick them up\",\n        \"Worked example in generate_lesson SKILL.md updated to show populated lesson-level sources (3+ entries) and one section-level source\",\n        \"Worked example in init_course SKILL.md updated to show sources.md output\",","numLines":125,"startLine":780,"totalLines":1307}}}
