{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017fF42Dp1Xt21K6SnY8QyGx","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# AI Lecturer\n2\t\n3\tA single-user, locally-hosted web app for studying interactive AI-generated lessons. The webapp renders courses produced by the offline `ralph` agent chain (course-spec → lesson generation) and tracks per-lesson progress on disk; it does not run the agents itself.\n4\t\n5\t## Stack\n6\t\n7\t- Next.js 15+ (App Router) · TypeScript (strict)\n8\t- Tailwind CSS v3\n9\t- shadcn/ui (initialized; components added per-story)\n10\t\n11\t## Run\n12\t\n13\t```bash\n14\tnpm install\n15\tnpm run dev       # http://localhost:3000\n16\tnpm run build     # production build\n17\tnpm run start     # serve the built app\n18\tnpm run lint      # eslint\n19\tnpm run typecheck # tsc --noEmit\n20\t```\n21\t\n22\t## Layout\n23\t\n24\t- `src/app/` — Next.js routes\n25\t- `src/components/` — shared UI (with `ui/` from shadcn)\n26\t- `src/widgets/` — per-widget lesson components (theory, quiz, code, demo, sandbox)\n27\t- `src/lib/` — utilities; `src/lib/schemas/` holds the Zod schemas shared with the agent chain\n28\t\n29\tGenerated courses live under `/courses/<slug>/`; per-user progress is stored at `~/.ai-lecturer/progress.json`.\n30\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9bf3d4c0-be72-4235-a7a7-0162ef2f8d69","uuid":"bfe6f76b-4cff-4e13-b21e-94e31ed1792c","timestamp":"2026-05-04T07:08:47.064Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/nukeemann/projects/ai_lecturer/.worktrees/US-056/README.md","content":"# AI Lecturer\n\nA single-user, locally-hosted web app for studying interactive AI-generated lessons. The webapp renders courses produced by the offline `ralph` agent chain (course-spec → lesson generation) and tracks per-lesson progress on disk; it does not run the agents itself.\n\n## Stack\n\n- Next.js 15+ (App Router) · TypeScript (strict)\n- Tailwind CSS v3\n- shadcn/ui (initialized; components added per-story)\n\n## Run\n\n```bash\nnpm install\nnpm run dev       # http://localhost:3000\nnpm run build     # production build\nnpm run start     # serve the built app\nnpm run lint      # eslint\nnpm run typecheck # tsc --noEmit\n```\n\n## Layout\n\n- `src/app/` — Next.js routes\n- `src/components/` — shared UI (with `ui/` from shadcn)\n- `src/widgets/` — per-widget lesson components (theory, quiz, code, demo, sandbox)\n- `src/lib/` — utilities; `src/lib/schemas/` holds the Zod schemas shared with the agent chain\n\nGenerated courses live under `/courses/<slug>/`; per-user progress is stored at `~/.ai-lecturer/progress.json`.\n","numLines":30,"startLine":1,"totalLines":30}}}
